/-!
# A072732

Simple triangle-stretching N X N -> N bijection: push terms in the middle twice as far down to make space for the terms obtained by bisecting the edges, which are thus contracted by the same factor. Do this for all "triangle-shells" successively contained inside each other in A001477.

The 68 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

